480	     4	/**
481	     5	 * The cache chapter's reading on the contents page: the current entry,
482	     6	 * straight from the same tagged entry the exhibit serves. Press rebake
483	     7	 * anywhere and this row changes with it — one entry, shared by every
484	     8	 * visitor, and by every page that reads it.
485	     9	 *
486	    10	 * One caveat, by construction: build workers bake independently, so a
487	    11	 * fresh deploy's static shells can open with this row and the landing
